PROJECT: www

STATUS: ONLINE

///

LOCAL:
 npm ci
 npm run dev

 http://localhost:4321

CHECK:
 npm run lint
 npm run build
 npm run typecheck
 npm run preview        the built site on the local Workers runtime

DEPLOY:
 npm run deploy         build and ship to Cloudflare; CI deploys main

///

MAP:
 src/pages/                 home, contact, writings, products, and the API routes
 src/layouts/               the document shell and the reader frame
 src/components/            shared navigation, conversations, and interactions
 src/content/               the writing and product copy, in Markdown and MDX
 public/writings/           photos and media filed with each writing
 public/token-usage-assets/ the token chart: HTML, JavaScript, and icons
 ops/token-usage/           usage collectors, publishing, and deployment tools
 docs/                      architecture, setup, and verification
 AGENTS.md                  the starting point for agents
 .agents/                   site direction and writing, design, and review skills

